  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Major Update: Performance Refactor & Architectural Optimization.\n      - Protocol Decoupling: Removed 'HttpSessionProtocol' and deprecated the 'IHttp' interface to eliminate composition and virtual dispatch overhead.\n      - JIT Optimization: Inlined all request processing logic directly into 'HttpSession' and 'HttpsSession' to maximize CPU Cache locality and JIT compiler inlining efficiency.\n      - Performance Gains: Achieved a 30-50% increase in throughput, consistently sustaining under high concurrency.\n      - Design Philosophy: Shifted to a 'Zero-allocation' model, accepting minor code duplication in exchange for peak execution performance and future scalability.",
